{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-10_beg","storyGroup":"main_15","storySort":222,"storyDependence":"main_15_level_main_15-10_beg","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"15-11","storyName":"一段长梦将醒","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"Friston-3做了一个梦，但奇怪的是可露希尔并没有为他安装构造梦境的模块。而刚刚醒来的泡普卡也从舷窗上看到了从未见过的身影。罗德岛开始发生异变。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_15-10_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_15-10","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["特雷弗·弗里斯顿","“女儿”","失落的声音","克丽斯腾","弗里斯顿","Friston-3","可露希尔","泡普卡","舷窗外的模糊声音","梓兰","？？？","痛苦的“小嘟嘟”","阿兰娜","阿米娅","源石结晶体"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_bg_bg_desert03_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormlp","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":6},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_sand","layer":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"弗里斯顿不明白为什么女儿要约自己在这里见面。","id":11},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"10","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":12},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fssand","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"......","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"这里可不算度假的好去处，鞋里太容易进沙子。","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"嗯，歇一歇吧。","id":16},{"type":"text","text":"他坐在沙丘上，脱下皮鞋。而倾倒下来的沙尘却随风扑向了他的脸，弄得他很狼狈。","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"咳咳，咳咳......","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"这也太不体面了——礼服？我为什么要穿全套的礼服？","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"......","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"她为什么约我来这？","id":21},{"type":"dialog","id":22},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fssand","id":23},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":24},{"type":"text","text":"通讯没有任何回应，他只能在黄沙中茫然地踱步，他呼唤着女儿的名字。","id":25},{"type":"text","text":"无人回应他，直到夜色来临。","id":26},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$bar_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act5d0/m_avg_longmenbar_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":28,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_bg_bg_desert03_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"3","id":29},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":30},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"4","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"......派对？","id":33},{"type":"text","text":"他循着声音找了过去，看到了远处沙丘上张灯结彩的营地。","id":34},{"type":"text","text":"他听到了女儿熟悉的笑声，他欣喜若狂地狂奔而去。","id":35},{"type":"dialog","id":36},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":37},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowrun","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"1","id":38},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":39},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“女儿”","text":"你还是赶来了我的婚礼，爸爸！","id":42},{"type":"text","text":"那头金发让弗里斯顿几乎要哭出来。","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"......我找了你很久，我的晨光。","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"这是你的婚礼？","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“女儿”","text":"当然，典礼快开始了，我们过去吧。","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“女儿”","text":"我们会挽着手走过红毯。祝福我吧，爸爸。","id":47},{"type":"text","text":"弗里斯顿想要牵住她的手，可总也够不到。","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“女儿”","text":"......你不想祝福我吗？","id":49},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"不......不......不是这样......我——","id":51},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":52},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"charslot","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":56},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8D/Avg_bg_38_g8_storage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":57},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":59},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":60,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_energybody","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"（未知语言）......我——","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"失落的声音","text":"......你不想祝福我吗？","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"（未知语言）......我的晨光？","id":64},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_537_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"你也并不期许我们看到那片真实的星空？","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_537_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"（未知语言）......你不是我的晨光。","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"（未知语言）我已经离开了家？这个地下掩体，我记得——","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"（未知语言）“保存间”。","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_537_1#1$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"......你不再回应我的请教了吗？","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_537_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"（未知语言）克丽斯腾。你是克丽斯腾......","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"（未知语言）我听说过你，不不，我见过你......不对，我是从哪知道了你？","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"（未知语言）我从没认识过你——","id":78},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":80},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorknob","id":81},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","text":"（未知语言）哪个混蛋关上了我的灯？！","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗里斯顿","text":"（未知语言）该死！","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弗里斯顿","text":"为什么要把我关在这里？","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"这又是某种无聊的恶作剧吗？可露希尔！","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":89},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesbedroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":92},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$sjoyasorrow_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_sjoyasorrow_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":93,"musicid":2},{"type":"text","text":"弗里斯顿发现自己被满房间的“照片”完全淹没了，而一本《泰拉全物种详考》的书册正盖在他的镜头模组上。","id":94},{"type":"text","text":"或许也算不上照片......他从未去过照片中的任何地方，也无法去到照片里的任何地方。","id":95},{"type":"text","text":"大量的照片上只印刷着零碎的影像。","id":96},{"type":"text","text":"沙丘、篝火、营地、金色的头发，还有那间暗无天日的保存间。","id":97},{"type":"dialog","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4093_frston_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"......梦？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4093_frston_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":102},{"type":"text","text":"弗里斯顿做了一个梦。Friston-3做了一个梦。","id":103},{"type":"text","text":"而他更是打印了自己的梦。","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4093_frston_1#1$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"......我不该有做梦的功能才对，是可露希尔偷偷上传了新的固件吗？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4093_frston_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"charslot","id":109},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesengineeringroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":110},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1723_1#11$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"弗里斯顿先生，我现在没有时间和你争论！","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_npc_1723_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"我可以非常明确地向你保证，我绝对绝对没有给你上传任何能让你做梦的固件。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_npc_1723_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"PRTS的异常越来越严重，备用指挥系统上线也还需要时间。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_npc_1723_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"......还得手动分配工作项，我现在眼睛已经快盯不过来了！而且某些区域已经完全失去了联系，情况完全不明——","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_npc_1723_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4093_frston_1#1$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"放轻松，可露希尔。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4093_frston_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"我并不是想要和你争论，只不过是在尝试排除引发我身体出现罕见故障的原因。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4093_frston_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"我们既然已经排除了固件报错和硬件故障的可能性，那——","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4093_frston_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"......","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4093_frston_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1723_1#8$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"怎么了？","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_npc_1723_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4093_frston_1#1$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"可露希尔，回答我一个很重要的问题......","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4093_frston_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"驱动我核心运转的能源是什么？","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4093_frston_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1723_1#8$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"欸，当然是源石。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_npc_1723_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4093_frston_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"你们的改型作业平台几乎都是源石驱动？","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4093_frston_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1723_1#11$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"......弗里斯顿先生，你的语气很可怕。你想说什么？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_npc_1723_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4093_frston_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"可露希尔，你是一个天才。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4093_frston_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1723_1#11$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"啊？","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_npc_1723_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4093_frston_1#1$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Friston-3","text":"你能想到提前切断所有改型作业平台与PRTS的连接，但恐怕这远远不够。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4093_frston_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"0.7","id":141},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1723_1#3$1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"嗯？怎么了？为什么突然开始颠簸了？","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_1723_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":145},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"charslot","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":149},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_bg_bg_room_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":150},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":152},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":153,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":156},{"type":"text","text":"泡普卡是被不断闪烁的亮光弄醒的。她看向舷窗外，却并没有发现任何异样。","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#1$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"......今天的天气很好，好像没有要下雨的样子。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":161},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"0.7","id":162},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#8$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"是，是其他人在外面训练弄出来的动静吗？","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0C/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#2$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"咦......PRTS的通讯还是没有恢复吗？","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#4$1","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"唔，今天好像是去舰外隔离带出外勤的日子，先去找梓兰姐姐报道吧。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":171},{"type":"charslot","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":173},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesupperdeck.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#5$1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"哈切~大家，都去哪了？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#2$1","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"好安静呀......梓兰姐姐现在在哪呢？唔，联系不上......","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#2$1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"先去食堂看看吧。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"食堂、食堂是在这边——","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":184},{"type":"text","text":"睡眼蒙眬的泡普卡闭着眼睛也知道从甲板走到食堂的路线。","id":185},{"type":"text","text":"她太熟悉罗德岛了——","id":186},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#8$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"欸，欸，啊啊啊啊！","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0C/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"0.6","id":191},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-50,-40","duration":"0.5","id":193},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"好、好痛......泡普卡，好痛......","id":196},{"type":"charslot","id":197},{"type":"text","text":"她发现自己被随意扔在走廊上的工程部箱子绊倒了。","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"好像......工程部最近确实在做很多改造，不过这片区域好像早就结束了呀......","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"呼，太粗心啦！","id":200},{"type":"text","text":"她蹲下揉了揉已经不怎么有痛感的膝盖，然后顺手将散落在地上的工具和箱子收到了走廊的边上。","id":201},{"type":"dialog","id":202},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":203},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"欸，又是那个光......到底......","id":205},{"type":"dialog","id":206},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","name":"char_281_popka_1#1","id":208},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":209},{"type":"text","text":"她站起身，下意识地看向了一旁的舷窗——","id":210},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"charslot","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":215},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_60_i07_1","style":"cg","layer":"2","id":216},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_60_i07.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":217},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":218},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_60_i07_2","style":"cg","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"3","layer":"1","pfrom":"0,-22","pto":"0,-22","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":220},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":221,"musicid":4},{"type":"text","text":"泡普卡看到了许多奇怪模样的人。","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"她们，是谁......？","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"......是新来的客人吗？","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"泡普卡记得，舷窗的那一边好像是甲板，她们是迷路了吗？","id":225},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"charslot","id":228},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_60_i07_2","id":229},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_60_i07.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":230},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"text","text":"她快速地在走廊中前进，但越走却越疑惑，于是她渐渐慢了下来......","id":232},{"type":"dialog","id":233},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_60_i07_2","style":"cg","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"2","layer":"1","pfrom":"0,-22","pto":"0,-22","id":234},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"为什么，每一扇舷窗上都能看到她们？","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"......","id":237},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"梓、梓兰姐姐，这里是泡普卡。","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"通讯系统好像还是有异常，我不知道你那边现在能不能收到......泡普卡的讯息。","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"你有发现一些奇怪的事情吗？","id":243},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":246},{"type":"text","text":"通讯中依旧没有传回梓兰的声音。","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"......","id":248},{"type":"dialog","id":249},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_60_i07_2","style":"cg","layer":"1","pfrom":"0,-22","pto":"-40,-22","pduration":"30","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"舷窗外的模糊声音","text":"（未知语言）当真正的毁灭......面前......无能为力......","id":251},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"舷窗外的模糊声音","text":"（未知语言）......平等的结局......","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"欸，她们，在说话吗？听不清......","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"......嗯，还是先执行任务要紧，梓兰姐姐她们是不是已经在舰外隔离带等泡普卡了......","id":255},{"type":"dialog","id":256},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":257},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":259},{"type":"image","id":260},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_60_i07_1","id":261},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_60_i07_2","id":262},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesupperdeck.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":263},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":264},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"......先左转......","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"再直走，然后推开门......","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"然后就是离舰通道——","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gatecloz","id":273},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":274},{"type":"charslot","id":275},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_elevator","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":276},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":277},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"先下降到地面......","id":279},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_explosion","volume":"0.3","id":281},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"欸？","id":283},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0.5","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":286},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_microwave","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"好像到了......","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"charslot","id":292},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B9/Avg_bg_bg_laccolith.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":295},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sandftsingle","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"泡普卡回头看向自己刚刚走出来的离舰通道，却发现它已经消失不见。","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#9$1","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"——？！","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5D/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"charslot","id":304},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fssand","volume":"0.7","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","duration":"1","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"泡普卡，我们正找你，大家都到齐了——","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......你遇到什么事了吗？","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#4$1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"梓、梓兰姐姐，离舰通道......是在这里吗？","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#4","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"离舰通道？","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_char_278_orchid_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":314},{"type":"dialog","id":315},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":316},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"group_interclude_vertical_common","size":"290,760","style":"0","switch":"true","offset":"0,0","channel":"3","tsfrom":"0,1","tsto":"1,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"——滋......所有能够收到通讯......干员注意......","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"......不要相信......滋......","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"通讯受阻......滋......罗德岛......醒了......","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可露希尔","text":"——警告......滋......再次——","id":322},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","tsduration":"0.5","tsfrom":"1,1","tsto":"0,1","id":324},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_imp_funnel_end_h","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#9$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"......可露希尔小姐？","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5D/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":330},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":332},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_bg_rhodescorner.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":335},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carrobotmove","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1726_1#2$1","bstart":"0.5","bend":"0.8","duration":"1","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（迷茫地前进）","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_avg_npc_1726_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":340},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_productdu_attack","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1726_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":342},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"痛苦的“小嘟嘟”","text":"（敌视的架势）","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_avg_npc_1726_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#6$1","duration":"0.5","id":346},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":347},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"0.3","id":349},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"350,0","duration":"0.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":351},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"抱歉了，小家伙。可不能再让你伤到其他人了。","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1726_1#2$1","duration":"0.5","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"6","times":"50","duration":"0.5","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"痛苦的“小嘟嘟”","text":"（生气地转圈）","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#6$1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"为什么你会突然攻击我们？","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"虽然暂时弄不清楚，不过本舰应该发生什么怪事了。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"你这小家伙突然失踪了一段时间，再回来的时候就变成这样了。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"而且，本舰的构造好像在持续发生变化，我都快迷路了。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#2$1","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"这种感觉太奇怪了。就像是......就像是这艘船——","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#10$1","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"活过来了。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D6/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":369},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":373},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_bg_bg_rhodescom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":374},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"playsound","key":"$alarmenter","id":376},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":378},{"type":"playsound","key":"$alarmenter","id":379},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":380},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tense_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_tense_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":382,"musicid":5},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"384","text":"敌袭警报？"}},"values":[],"id":383},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":384,"end":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#10$2","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"这怎么可能......我们明明已经在罗德岛周围设立了隔离带。如果有敌人来袭的话，我们一定会提前收到警告才对。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-10$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":388},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"390","text":"除非......敌人是来自内部。"}},"values":[],"id":389},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":390,"end":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"我不确定......我们在总指挥室，现在这里却观测不到罗德岛上任何一处的状态！","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"向凯尔希医生和其他精英干员发出的消息，也没有得到任何回复......","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":395},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"397","text":"我们去找他们。"},"2":{"id":"397","text":"先把大家聚集在一起，再想办法解决。"}},"values":[],"id":396},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":397,"end":399},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"嗯，我来负责保护博士。","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":403},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_icecrystlncrse","id":404},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_bg_bg_rhodescom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","x":"30","id":405},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":406},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":407},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1727_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","id":408},{"type":"charslot","sl